WEBVTT

00:17.540 --> 00:19.580
(Byeon Woo Seok)

00:21.150 --> 00:22.348
(CEO)

00:22.349 --> 00:23.349
(10 missed calls from CEO)

00:25.949 --> 00:27.919
(Kim Hye Yoon)

00:34.660 --> 00:37.859
(Lovely Runner)

00:45.830 --> 00:48.239
You should be polite.

00:48.240 --> 00:49.469
Hello.

00:49.470 --> 00:51.299
What's wrong with you?

00:51.300 --> 00:52.639
It's raining.

00:58.810 --> 00:59.850
Hey.

01:12.730 --> 01:13.929
Why are you crying, then?

01:14.029 --> 01:15.159
I didn't make you cry.

01:15.160 --> 01:17.560
(Breaking News)

01:22.770 --> 01:24.140
Why are you crying?

01:27.169 --> 01:29.009
Why do you always cry when you see me?

01:37.350 --> 01:39.490
What did I say to make you cry?

01:40.149 --> 01:41.859
Hey, I think he made her cry.

01:41.860 --> 01:43.519
Come on. It must be a lover's quarrel.

01:43.520 --> 01:44.659
What's going on? What did he do wrong to make her cry like that?

01:44.660 --> 01:45.660
What is it?

01:45.661 --> 01:47.889
- Come this way for now.
- Hey, it looks serious.

01:47.890 --> 01:49.030
Hey.

01:49.860 --> 01:50.929
Sun Jae!

01:55.270 --> 01:57.539
(Episode 2)

02:10.179 --> 02:11.850
After all the things I said yesterday,

02:12.289 --> 02:14.990
why am I crying without saying a word today?

02:33.169 --> 02:36.579
So this is how you looked when you were 19.

02:44.449 --> 02:46.190
Why is she staring at me like that?

02:54.530 --> 02:56.460
- What are you?
- What?

02:57.299 --> 02:59.369
I'm a fan, sir. No.

02:59.370 --> 03:01.429
I'm a fan of yours, Let's Kidnap Sun Jae and Run.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.470
What?

03:03.299 --> 03:05.210
That's my username in your fan community.

03:05.509 --> 03:06.509
What are you talking about?

03:06.510 --> 03:08.479
I know. What nonsense am I saying?

03:08.940 --> 03:10.809
Sun Jae is an ordinary student now.

03:10.810 --> 03:12.180
I can't do this.

03:14.979 --> 03:18.350
My name is Sol. Im Sol.

03:18.690 --> 03:19.720
I know.

03:20.150 --> 03:21.220
How?

03:24.060 --> 03:25.389
(Im Sol)

03:27.590 --> 03:29.199
Why do you always cry when you see me?

03:29.859 --> 03:31.000
You cried yesterday too.

03:32.269 --> 03:34.069
Well, that's because...

03:35.199 --> 03:37.069
you remind me of something.

03:38.340 --> 03:41.309
Something I liked very much.

03:41.310 --> 03:42.310
Something you liked?

03:45.049 --> 03:46.180
A dog.

03:47.150 --> 03:48.948
A dog? I look like a dog?

03:48.949 --> 03:50.750
That's not it.

03:50.819 --> 03:53.690
That dog was a great swimmer.

03:53.750 --> 03:54.850
So you're saying...

03:55.319 --> 03:58.219
I look like a dog that was a great swimmer?

03:58.220 --> 03:59.289
That's what it is, I guess.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.930
How did you know about the game and come to the arena yesterday?

04:03.359 --> 04:04.460
You knew my name as well.

04:05.430 --> 04:07.430
Okay. Let's try to fix it.

04:07.930 --> 04:10.139
It can't be difficult to convince a 19-year-old.

04:11.710 --> 04:13.669
I'm a fan of swimming.

04:13.769 --> 04:15.379
- A fan of swimming?
- Yes.

04:15.380 --> 04:17.780
I told you. My dog was a great swimmer.

04:17.979 --> 04:20.309
Naturally, I became a fan of swimming.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.608
Watching the videos of swimming competitions,

04:21.609 --> 04:24.219
I naturally learned about you, the ace of the swimming team.

04:24.220 --> 04:27.488
So naturally, I went there to cheer you on.

04:27.489 --> 04:29.418
Watching you swimming,

04:29.419 --> 04:33.059
my dog came to my mind naturally. And I got emotional.

04:33.060 --> 04:34.858
So naturally, I said I love you.

04:34.859 --> 04:36.559
It doesn't sound natural at all.

04:36.830 --> 04:37.900
Okay.

04:46.910 --> 04:49.010
Anyway, you were flustered a lot, right?

04:49.679 --> 04:51.640
It's all because you remind me of my dog.

04:52.910 --> 04:54.478
What's the name of the dog?

04:54.479 --> 04:56.320
The name?

04:56.549 --> 04:58.080
The name is...

04:59.820 --> 05:01.248
- Otter.
- You called your dog Otter?

05:01.249 --> 05:03.460
They're good swimmers. Both otters and my Otter.

05:03.590 --> 05:06.288
Why didn't you name your dog Seal then?

05:06.289 --> 05:08.059
Oh, that's a great idea.

05:09.059 --> 05:10.059
My goodness.

05:15.640 --> 05:16.669
Take it.

05:17.900 --> 05:19.970
Did you also give this to me because of Otter?

05:24.309 --> 05:25.649
It's yours. Take it.

05:25.650 --> 05:27.909
Oh, my gosh.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.179
No, Sun Jae.

05:29.379 --> 05:30.579
Let's live together.

05:30.580 --> 05:32.488
Let's live together.

05:32.489 --> 05:33.590
Darn it.

05:35.520 --> 05:38.788
Oh, my gosh. I'll be running late.

05:38.789 --> 05:40.358
I'll get going first. I'm sorry.

05:40.359 --> 05:42.899
What? Hey, where are you going?

05:42.900 --> 05:43.999
My goodness.

05:47.700 --> 05:48.739
Hey!

05:50.100 --> 05:53.210
I should've not opened my mouth. He'd think I'm weird.

05:54.640 --> 05:56.608
Why did I bring this?

05:56.609 --> 05:58.080
He'll get rained on.

05:58.410 --> 06:00.309
I'm so dumb.

06:02.950 --> 06:04.879
What? This is my classroom.

06:07.090 --> 06:09.559
Thinking it was a dream, I didn't take a good look at it yesterday.

06:11.859 --> 06:15.160
- Hey.
- That's what he said.

06:15.729 --> 06:16.999
- Here.
- Give it to me.

06:17.629 --> 06:19.769
- Don't hide it.
- This is...

06:19.770 --> 06:21.570
- Seriously.
- Hey.

06:27.239 --> 06:29.840
I haven't seen them for a long time.

06:31.739 --> 06:34.179
Have you guys been doing well?

06:34.850 --> 06:37.079
Oh, my. Hi.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.788
Da Hye. Bo Rim.

06:38.789 --> 06:40.389
It's been such a long time.

06:40.390 --> 06:43.059
Young Sun, I remember you were an excellent student.

06:43.960 --> 06:45.460
What was your name?

06:45.859 --> 06:47.189
Oh, right. Kim Eun Ju.

06:47.289 --> 06:49.330
You cuties.

06:49.429 --> 06:51.359
Hi.

06:51.600 --> 06:53.100
Sol, what was it yesterday?

06:54.369 --> 06:56.970
Hyun Ju.

06:57.570 --> 06:59.769
I'm so happy to see you! Oh, my gosh.

06:59.770 --> 07:01.038
Where did you go, skipping school?

07:01.039 --> 07:02.939
You weren't there when I went to your house to give your bag to you.

07:03.210 --> 07:05.478
Oh, my gosh. Your skin is amazing.

07:05.479 --> 07:07.949
You were so sad about your freckles, girl.

07:07.950 --> 07:10.379
Be honest with me. Something happened yesterday morning, right?

07:10.619 --> 07:11.619
What?

07:11.620 --> 07:14.618
I can't remember because I wasn't myself yesterday morning.

07:14.619 --> 07:16.719
What did he say to make you lose your mind...

07:16.720 --> 07:18.389
and skip school, which you've never done before?

07:18.390 --> 07:19.590
Yesterday? He?

07:21.059 --> 07:23.228
- Good morning, ma'am.
- Good morning, ma'am.

07:23.229 --> 07:26.600
Oh, my gosh. Ma'am!

07:30.400 --> 07:31.569
Ms. Kwon.

07:31.570 --> 07:33.339
I tried to let out this place a long time ago,

07:33.340 --> 07:34.868
but there's still no tenant.

07:34.869 --> 07:36.038
Are you even trying?

07:36.039 --> 07:38.108
Don't let it out. Just sell it...

07:38.109 --> 07:39.580
and buy an apartment in Pangyo.

07:39.780 --> 07:42.149
When the subway opens, the price will skyrocket.

07:42.150 --> 07:45.350
Pangyo, the empty plain next to Bundang?

07:46.189 --> 07:47.390
The price surely increased dramatically.

07:48.220 --> 07:50.389
The price of apartments in Seoul will decrease only.

07:50.390 --> 07:51.419
Why would I buy an apartment in Pangyo?

07:51.760 --> 07:53.260
"Basic Instincts."

07:53.760 --> 07:54.760
(Overdue)

07:54.761 --> 07:55.900
It's been overdue for as long as a month.

07:56.059 --> 07:57.200
Who on earth is it?

07:59.570 --> 08:00.830
(Ryu Geun Duk)

08:01.299 --> 08:02.738
This is Gold Videos.

08:02.739 --> 08:04.298
Please return the tape.

08:04.299 --> 08:06.538
I haven't rented anything.

08:06.539 --> 08:09.909
I'm calling you because you did.

08:09.910 --> 08:11.909
You rented "Basic Instincts."

08:11.910 --> 08:14.850
My gosh. I didn't rent it.

08:15.109 --> 08:18.178
And who watches a VHS tape these days?

08:18.179 --> 08:19.850
We don't even watch DVDs that much anymore.

08:20.489 --> 08:21.520
What did you say?

08:22.590 --> 08:24.959
Your family might've rented it.

08:24.960 --> 08:26.160
Please check it.

08:26.489 --> 08:28.128
Please return it quickly.

08:28.129 --> 08:29.900
The overdue fine is 15 dollars.

08:31.299 --> 08:32.868
This guy is funny.

08:32.869 --> 08:34.769
He was embarrassed about renting a R-rated movie.

08:34.770 --> 08:35.868
So he pretended not to know about it.

08:35.869 --> 08:37.400
I guess he watched it until the tape was stretched.

08:40.939 --> 08:43.978
The Great Wisdom Heart Sutra

08:43.979 --> 08:46.209
Avalokiteshvara Bodhisattva

08:46.210 --> 08:48.009
- He came to receive offerings.
- When practicing deeply

08:48.010 --> 08:50.450
- The Prajna Paramita - We're Christians.

08:50.580 --> 08:52.989
- Amen.
- Hallelujah.

08:53.590 --> 08:56.820
Bodhisattva Avalokiteshvara.

08:59.259 --> 09:01.460
I'm the bodhisattva.

09:01.759 --> 09:04.628
I'm the bodhisattva who is living with you.

09:04.629 --> 09:05.670
Come on!

09:06.499 --> 09:08.999
- Mom.
- Are you Geum?

09:09.170 --> 09:10.470
You completely fooled me.

09:10.800 --> 09:13.368
What is it called? Oh, right. Mammoth acting.

09:13.369 --> 09:14.638
It was perfect.

09:14.639 --> 09:16.539
Right? I'm a good actor, right?

09:16.540 --> 09:17.710
What do you mean you're good?

09:17.840 --> 09:20.248
What kind of audition is it this time?

09:20.249 --> 09:23.450
Why do you always make a scene? You can't become an actor.

09:23.550 --> 09:25.748
Mom, you never know.

09:25.749 --> 09:28.789
Who knows? I might step on the red carpet at Cannes Film Festival.

09:28.790 --> 09:30.290
All the things you say make me want to step on you.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.430
Get out.

09:32.590 --> 09:34.658
You could go there as my family too!

09:34.659 --> 09:36.060
Cannes Film Festival, my foot.

09:36.259 --> 09:39.569
If you draw a graph based on these conditions, it looks like this.

09:39.570 --> 09:40.728
Take a look.

09:40.729 --> 09:42.840
Time isn't passing.

09:43.840 --> 09:47.310
Yes. I think I travelled to the past when I pressed this button.

09:48.509 --> 09:51.040
Is this like a time machine?

09:52.180 --> 09:55.180
I might be able to go back if I press the button again.

09:57.279 --> 10:00.290
No. What if I go back and can't come back?

10:00.720 --> 10:01.988
I should never press it.

10:01.989 --> 10:03.590
Number 15. Come out and solve it.

10:09.499 --> 10:11.300
Hey. You're number 15.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.300
Nothing has changed.

10:16.739 --> 10:18.239
- Im Sol.
- Yes?

10:18.300 --> 10:20.810
- Come out.
- Yes, ma'am.

10:21.609 --> 10:23.239
That was close.

10:23.710 --> 10:25.580
This is a bigger problem.

10:26.409 --> 10:27.909
I blame the passage of time.

10:28.409 --> 10:30.149
How can I not remember anything?

10:34.019 --> 10:35.618
What's the matter? Are you sick?

10:35.619 --> 10:37.889
Yes. I have cramps.

10:39.060 --> 10:40.858
I have bad cramps during my period.

10:40.859 --> 10:41.959
Go to the infirmary.

10:41.960 --> 10:43.859
Okay. I'm sorry.

10:44.259 --> 10:46.499
Oh, my gosh. My back hurts.

10:47.970 --> 10:50.070
Her period ended last week.

10:54.869 --> 10:57.879
(Jagam High School)

10:58.080 --> 11:00.550
Where is my Sun Jae?

11:02.180 --> 11:03.519
Oh, he's over there.

11:06.590 --> 11:09.290
It's nice that I can watch him easily when I want to.

11:13.729 --> 11:15.898
Hey, the competition is around the corner.

11:15.899 --> 11:17.929
- What is this?
- You got this!

11:17.930 --> 11:20.170
- You got this!
- You got this!

11:20.229 --> 11:21.229
We got this!

11:25.200 --> 11:28.639
I'll protect you by your side from now on.

11:29.409 --> 11:31.080
So that you will never have bad thoughts.

11:33.550 --> 11:36.180
I should stick to him for 15 years then.

11:36.450 --> 11:37.850
How can I get close to him?

11:44.060 --> 11:45.590
Why does it smell like cigarettes?

11:50.700 --> 11:51.729
What?

12:04.639 --> 12:06.709
Don't do it. Seriously.

12:06.710 --> 12:10.219
Those punks are smoking here of all places.

12:10.220 --> 12:11.649
The smoke is entering the gym.

12:11.749 --> 12:12.989
Those delinquent kids.

12:20.529 --> 12:21.529
Are you smiling?

12:24.060 --> 12:25.430
I should just...

12:27.700 --> 12:28.700
Darn it.

12:29.399 --> 12:30.399
You're dead!

12:40.479 --> 12:42.580
- Darn it.
- You punks!

12:47.619 --> 12:50.190
- Gosh.
- Oh, my.

12:50.820 --> 12:52.290
My goodness.

12:55.489 --> 12:56.499
Darn it.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.829
You crazy witch! How dare you!

12:58.830 --> 13:00.430
How dare you!

13:00.529 --> 13:01.570
"Witch?"

13:01.800 --> 13:03.639
How dare you say that to a woman older than you?

13:04.440 --> 13:07.509
You're fighting and smoking in someone else's school.

13:07.570 --> 13:09.079
The gym is near here.

13:09.080 --> 13:11.909
Do you know how bad secondhand smoke is for the swimmers' lungs?

13:11.979 --> 13:13.148
You try so hard to look cool.

13:13.149 --> 13:14.509
I'm confiscating this. Go now.

13:15.050 --> 13:16.919
I told you to go. Are you not going?

13:16.920 --> 13:18.820
Hey. What?

13:19.450 --> 13:21.350
Excuse me, ma'am. I think we should run.

13:23.560 --> 13:24.659
What? Hey!

13:56.720 --> 13:58.519
Kids these days are scary.

13:59.129 --> 14:01.830
No. Are they kids in the past?

14:03.460 --> 14:04.600
Did you take a year off?

14:06.029 --> 14:07.529
I took 15 years off.

14:07.830 --> 14:09.840
I confiscated it and you took it?

14:10.600 --> 14:11.639
Give it to me.

14:13.840 --> 14:14.908
You don't look like you're older than me.

14:14.909 --> 14:15.979
Give it to me.

14:20.649 --> 14:21.680
What?

14:22.080 --> 14:24.220
- I saw you somewhere.
- You...

14:24.479 --> 14:26.420
(September 2007, Jagam High School festival)

14:27.220 --> 14:28.519
I love you.

14:37.259 --> 14:38.729
Yes. I remember.

14:39.100 --> 14:42.029
The first artist I became a fan of and my favourite in the past.

14:43.399 --> 14:45.470
What was your name?

14:45.670 --> 14:46.710
(Kim Tae Sung)

14:47.909 --> 14:49.778
Oh, right. Kim Tae Sung.

14:49.779 --> 14:52.648
Oh, my goodness. It's so nice to see you.

14:52.649 --> 14:55.149
- How long has it been?
- What?

14:55.950 --> 14:57.819
- Yesterday, you...
- I used to chase after you...

14:57.820 --> 14:59.249
like crazy.

15:00.220 --> 15:01.719
You looked so cool back then.

15:01.720 --> 15:03.690
But looking at you now, you look tacky.

15:03.989 --> 15:05.019
So it's you.

15:05.359 --> 15:07.430
Why are you so different from yesterday?

15:07.629 --> 15:08.758
Do you have multiple personalities?

15:08.759 --> 15:09.859
Oh, my.

15:10.159 --> 15:12.728
I didn't know because I was blinded by love back then.

15:12.729 --> 15:14.869
But you're a delinquent kid.

15:16.269 --> 15:18.200
Smoking cigarettes and stuff.

15:19.470 --> 15:21.069
Get it together.

15:21.070 --> 15:23.210
- Smoking is nothing but bad.
- Okay, ma'am.

15:23.710 --> 15:25.340
I'll give this to you too.

15:27.310 --> 15:29.879
Good luck with running away by yourself this time. Okay?

15:31.019 --> 15:33.149
- What?
- I got you guys!

15:38.259 --> 15:39.629
You skipped class.

15:39.960 --> 15:42.258
What are these? Did you smoke?

15:42.259 --> 15:43.300
Pardon?

15:45.229 --> 15:47.399
No. These are not mine.

15:47.930 --> 15:50.899
That punk!

15:53.369 --> 15:56.080
I only taught delinquent students a lesson.

15:56.340 --> 15:58.408
I plucked up my courage to keep the lungs of the athletes healthy...

15:58.409 --> 16:01.579
and prevent secondhand smoke.

16:01.580 --> 16:02.820
This is unfair.

16:03.149 --> 16:05.549
So a girl came to a boys' high school...

16:05.550 --> 16:08.220
and taught other students a lesson?

16:10.359 --> 16:12.159
How dare you lie to me!

16:12.560 --> 16:13.889
I should just...

16:14.690 --> 16:16.258
I wasn't punished even when I was a high school student.

16:16.259 --> 16:17.960
But I'm receiving a punishment when I'm over 30.

16:20.700 --> 16:23.200
Oh, no. Please pass by.

16:23.470 --> 16:24.739
Straighten your posture.

16:28.810 --> 16:29.939
- Please.
- Hey.

16:29.940 --> 16:31.579
Just go quickly.

16:31.580 --> 16:32.810
Please go.

16:34.180 --> 16:35.310
Peekaboo.

16:35.680 --> 16:37.680
Where do you think you're joking around?

16:38.119 --> 16:40.350
Stay like this until the bell rings.

16:40.850 --> 16:42.758
I'll be watching you through the security camera.

16:42.759 --> 16:44.519
Don't even try to slack. Got it?

16:55.729 --> 16:56.840
Otter...

16:59.570 --> 17:01.170
will be so sad.

17:01.509 --> 17:02.509
What?

17:03.340 --> 17:04.879
Seeing its owner living recklessly.

17:05.379 --> 17:06.409
Quit smoking.

17:07.979 --> 17:09.450
No.

17:09.580 --> 17:10.819
I don't even burn mosquito repellents in summer,

17:10.820 --> 17:12.220
let alone smoke.

17:12.519 --> 17:15.249
I do drink a little when I'm having a hard time, but I don't...

17:18.560 --> 17:20.830
Sun Jae. I don't smoke.

17:22.429 --> 17:23.958
I was a model student.

17:23.959 --> 17:25.399
- For real.
- Oh, right.

17:27.230 --> 17:29.340
That camera is fake, not real. So you can just go.

17:33.540 --> 17:35.510
Wait. Not before I clear the misunderstandings.

17:37.209 --> 17:38.340
Sun Jae.

17:39.879 --> 17:44.350
(Quit Smoking.)

17:52.189 --> 17:55.128
I told you to run away. Why did you follow him and receive a punishment?

17:55.129 --> 17:56.829
Did you wait for me to make me angry?

17:56.830 --> 17:58.259
I waited for you to get my lighter back.

17:58.260 --> 17:59.330
I threw it away.

17:59.429 --> 18:00.969
You're so disloyal.

18:01.169 --> 18:03.299
I saved you from the bullies.

18:03.300 --> 18:04.369
And you ran away by yourself?

18:05.169 --> 18:06.939
- Were you trying to save me?
- Yes.

18:07.709 --> 18:08.968
I ran away with you as you were coming at him,

18:08.969 --> 18:10.040
and I was worried you might get hit.

18:10.439 --> 18:11.540
Oh, I got it.

18:12.949 --> 18:14.749
I guess you wanted my attention.

18:14.750 --> 18:15.780
What?

18:15.850 --> 18:17.179
I didn't know you were this kind of guy.

18:17.419 --> 18:18.779
You're unbelievably annoying.

18:18.780 --> 18:19.949
Thanks for the compliment.

18:20.020 --> 18:21.020
But hey,

18:25.990 --> 18:28.030
don't step forward and think about your own safety from now on.

18:31.260 --> 18:32.459
Or you'll get hurt badly.

18:34.369 --> 18:36.899
Why did I like someone like him when I was younger?

18:37.139 --> 18:38.240
Tae Sung!

18:38.770 --> 18:40.409
Gosh, she's bothering me again.

18:45.280 --> 18:47.310
Hey! Tae Sung!

18:54.719 --> 18:56.859
Hey. Get out of my way.

19:02.730 --> 19:04.129
That was so rude!

19:08.270 --> 19:10.899
Hey. What did you just say?

19:20.109 --> 19:22.079
Hey, look down.

19:22.080 --> 19:24.149
Oh, my gosh. Look at you.

19:28.050 --> 19:29.119
Look down.

19:34.030 --> 19:36.199
Let's think about my own safety. Or I'll get hurt badly.

19:39.300 --> 19:42.129
Don't you dare come near Tae Sung again.

19:45.669 --> 19:46.709
Let's go.

19:47.369 --> 19:48.439
Gosh.

19:52.480 --> 19:54.879
The kids in the past are scary.

20:02.490 --> 20:04.760
I got a new key ring for my phone. Isn't it cute?

20:05.560 --> 20:07.459
Gosh, you're cuter.

20:09.359 --> 20:11.929
Hyun Ju, I can walk again.

20:12.869 --> 20:15.369
You would've been so happy if you had seen me walking.

20:16.639 --> 20:17.868
Do you want to get a bread refill?

20:17.869 --> 20:19.840
No. Hold back. Your uniform will burst.

20:20.969 --> 20:23.080
You'll lose weight when you're older. Just eat.

20:23.310 --> 20:24.809
No. I'm going to hold back.

20:24.810 --> 20:26.050
Oh, right.

20:26.209 --> 20:28.909
I must get close to someone. What should I do?

20:30.149 --> 20:32.919
It's been too long since I got close to someone and opened up my heart.

20:33.219 --> 20:34.520
So I don't know how.

20:35.119 --> 20:37.260
First of all, the first impression is important.

20:37.459 --> 20:38.490
The first impression?

20:39.959 --> 20:41.530
- Mom.
- No.

20:41.889 --> 20:43.060
Let's live together.

20:43.129 --> 20:44.899
Let's try living together.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.069
It was the worst.

20:47.070 --> 20:48.800
The second impression better be good, then.

20:51.639 --> 20:52.668
Quit smoking.

20:52.669 --> 20:54.108
- It was even worse.
- Give it up, then.

20:54.109 --> 20:55.240
No!

20:56.109 --> 20:57.810
Then don't approach the person hastily.

20:58.939 --> 21:00.179
Ask the person to be your Ilchon.

21:00.909 --> 21:02.580
What? Ilchon?

21:05.879 --> 21:06.919
Is this person a guy?

21:09.490 --> 21:10.990
You've moved on to another guy already?

21:11.159 --> 21:13.029
I thought you were gloomy because you got rejected...

21:13.030 --> 21:14.490
when you asked Tae Sung out yesterday.

21:15.389 --> 21:16.500
What?

21:18.060 --> 21:22.229
I've had a crush on you since I saw you perform...

21:22.230 --> 21:24.070
in the school festival last year.

21:26.070 --> 21:30.040
This is... my gift to you.

21:31.639 --> 21:32.879
Hey, Tae Sung.

21:35.449 --> 21:36.550
You.

21:36.679 --> 21:37.980
Who the heck are you?

21:38.919 --> 21:40.219
Gosh.

21:40.520 --> 21:41.750
Look at her.

21:42.250 --> 21:44.290
I won't let you get away next time!

21:44.790 --> 21:47.129
That little piece of rat ran away again.

21:49.530 --> 21:52.230
Hyun Ju, did I ask Tae Sung out yesterday?

21:53.199 --> 21:55.628
I wondered why the stars were missing from the night sky.

21:55.629 --> 21:57.300
I guess they were in your eyes.

21:57.699 --> 22:00.269
No wonder why I couldn't see you straight.

22:00.270 --> 22:01.669
It was because you were so bright.

22:02.070 --> 22:05.379
Tae Sung, you are my star.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.679
A big star.

22:07.250 --> 22:08.649
Did it have to be yesterday?

22:08.980 --> 22:10.480
I should have come a day earlier.

22:11.879 --> 22:13.350
This is embarrassing.

22:14.389 --> 22:16.359
Why were the stars missing from the night sky?

22:16.389 --> 22:18.559
They were in your eyes.

22:18.560 --> 22:19.689
What is it?

22:20.929 --> 22:22.159
When did you get in here?

22:23.600 --> 22:24.699
Give it back to me!

22:26.969 --> 22:29.000
When did you unbox it?

22:30.100 --> 22:31.169
Give it to me.

22:31.540 --> 22:32.770
Get out.

22:32.939 --> 22:35.209
- Get out already!
- Hey.

22:35.939 --> 22:37.280
Hey.

22:41.179 --> 22:42.350
I almost had them.

22:49.859 --> 22:51.458
Then don't approach the person hastily.

22:51.459 --> 22:52.830
Ask the person to be your Ilchon.

23:15.179 --> 23:17.149
(Im Sol wants to be Ilchon to Ryu Sun Jae.)

23:25.590 --> 23:28.529
He was crazy about swimming at this time.

23:28.530 --> 23:29.659
(A new message has arrived.)

23:33.629 --> 23:34.869
(From. Sun Jae)

23:36.770 --> 23:37.839
(Ryu Sun Jae has declined to be your Ilchon.)

23:37.840 --> 23:39.000
(Don't be upset and find other precious friends.)

23:42.439 --> 23:47.609
(Declining the offer to be Ilchon)

24:00.990 --> 24:03.530
It feels like we are getting further away.

24:03.929 --> 24:05.600
He refused to be my Ilchon.

24:10.969 --> 24:12.070
Let me help you.

24:13.609 --> 24:14.969
- Here.
- Thank you.

24:29.689 --> 24:30.760
Please wait!

24:44.300 --> 24:46.810
We use the same bus stop to take the bus.

24:47.469 --> 24:49.609
Have we ever taken the same bus before?

24:51.080 --> 24:53.010
Have you seen me before?

24:53.449 --> 24:54.580
Even if I have, I haven't seen you.

24:56.109 --> 24:57.850
Have you seen me or not?

24:59.419 --> 25:00.749
Do you always ride the bus at this hour?

25:00.750 --> 25:02.250
I usually go to school earlier.

25:02.520 --> 25:04.118
I don't have early morning practice because the competition is near.

25:04.119 --> 25:05.159
That's why I'm going to school now.

25:06.290 --> 25:08.359
I should ride the bus when he rides it from now...

25:08.629 --> 25:09.800
to be close to him.

25:10.100 --> 25:12.299
Do you have a competition soon? What kind of a competition?

25:12.300 --> 25:13.398
If I tell you,

25:13.399 --> 25:14.529
are you going to come running again?

25:14.530 --> 25:15.570
Well...

25:20.540 --> 25:21.609
Get off.

25:23.740 --> 25:24.879
- We're here.
- Yes.

25:25.080 --> 25:26.878
- Hey.
- Don't push.

25:26.879 --> 25:28.580
- Excuse me.
- Come on!

25:28.679 --> 25:30.519
- I'm getting off.
- Gosh.

25:30.520 --> 25:32.280
Excuse me.

25:32.780 --> 25:34.249
- I'm getting off.
- Excuse me.

25:34.250 --> 25:35.589
- Excuse me. I'm getting off.
- Please wait.

25:35.590 --> 25:37.290
- Excuse me.
- Please wait.

25:40.530 --> 25:42.359
Hey. I have to get off.

25:42.889 --> 25:44.959
- It's because of you.
- He's so hot.

25:45.659 --> 25:47.100
- It's your fault.
- Sir.

25:47.330 --> 25:48.500
Sir!

25:48.600 --> 25:50.399
I couldn't get off.

26:28.510 --> 26:30.379
Sir, please stop.

26:31.540 --> 26:32.580
Stop.

26:35.649 --> 26:37.379
He's awesome.

26:37.719 --> 26:38.879
Sun Jae.

26:40.090 --> 26:41.449
Sun Jae, are you all right?

26:43.490 --> 26:44.559
Hey.

26:44.560 --> 26:46.929
You have to keep it together. How could you not get off?

26:50.600 --> 26:51.959
Still, thank you.

26:52.000 --> 26:53.500
I didn't do it for you.

26:56.070 --> 26:57.669
I stopped the bus to take my umbrella back.

26:58.439 --> 27:00.340
Right. I was going to give it to you.

27:01.270 --> 27:03.780
Still, don't do that next time because it's dangerous.

27:03.840 --> 27:05.679
Who tries to beat the bus by running?

27:05.939 --> 27:07.209
You're an athlete.

27:07.350 --> 27:09.409
You have to be careful and always play it safe.

27:09.649 --> 27:12.019
If someone with my umbrella did get off the bus,

27:12.020 --> 27:13.149
I would have played it safe.

27:13.389 --> 27:15.619
Gosh. Is this what he was like when he was younger?

27:17.659 --> 27:19.359
You are constantly talking back.

27:19.520 --> 27:21.129
Your father must have a headache because of you.

27:21.459 --> 27:22.530
Look who's talking.

27:22.760 --> 27:24.030
Quit smoking.

27:25.159 --> 27:26.669
How did I fall in...

27:28.530 --> 27:29.668
Is that why...

27:29.669 --> 27:31.869
you declined my request to be your Ilchon?

27:32.139 --> 27:33.540
Why? Do you feel guilty?

27:34.369 --> 27:36.040
I said I was innocent.

27:36.340 --> 27:37.679
Here. Do you want to smell them?

27:37.879 --> 27:40.379
The fingers of a smoker smell like cigarettes.

27:40.580 --> 27:41.580
Smell them.

27:44.780 --> 27:45.979
See?

27:45.980 --> 27:47.149
They don't smell, do they?

27:56.129 --> 27:57.730
You're right. They don't smell.

27:57.899 --> 28:03.570
(Humiliation)

28:05.770 --> 28:08.070
Why did you crawl into his nose?

28:11.580 --> 28:12.779
Hey.

28:12.780 --> 28:14.909
That's not a nose. That's an outlet.

28:15.010 --> 28:16.350
Who was he talking to?

28:17.320 --> 28:18.878
It's a 220-volt outlet.

28:18.879 --> 28:21.219
Come on. Stop bothering me.

28:22.590 --> 28:24.320
I thought you said there was nothing between you two.

28:24.359 --> 28:25.560
But you come to the school together.

28:26.359 --> 28:27.888
I just got my umbrella back.

28:27.889 --> 28:29.230
Right. Your umbrella.

28:30.060 --> 28:32.300
Right. I remembered where I saw her.

28:32.459 --> 28:33.830
It was in our practice room.

28:34.169 --> 28:35.628
She has a crush on Kim Tae Sung.

28:35.629 --> 28:37.740
She came and left chocolates for him secretly.

28:38.139 --> 28:39.840
No wonder she looked familiar.

28:41.070 --> 28:42.209
Who is this Kim Tae Sung?

28:42.869 --> 28:44.280
He is the bassist of our band.

28:44.510 --> 28:46.010
He is known as the best-looking guy on the internet.

28:46.609 --> 28:47.780
Don't you know him?

28:47.879 --> 28:49.010
I don't know him.

28:49.080 --> 28:51.020
- Why?
- What?

28:51.179 --> 28:52.350
Why are you getting angry?

28:54.350 --> 28:55.449
I didn't get angry.

29:01.359 --> 29:02.959
- Isn't it amazing?
- I mean...

29:03.300 --> 29:04.429
Come on down.

29:07.230 --> 29:08.770
That was what I wanted to do.

29:10.740 --> 29:12.270
(Jagam High School's bulletin board)

29:15.340 --> 29:16.639
(The 27th Presidential Cup Swimming Tournament)

29:16.840 --> 29:21.250
It was the first competition after my shoulder surgery.

29:22.179 --> 29:23.280
That competition...

29:23.980 --> 29:25.820
ended up being my last one.

29:26.379 --> 29:27.520
Was it this tournament?

29:29.889 --> 29:31.520
Cool! Check the menu.

29:31.919 --> 29:32.919
Will you stop...

29:34.590 --> 29:36.358
Sun Jae, can I talk to you for a second?

29:36.359 --> 29:37.699
Hey, use what I taught you yesterday.

29:39.760 --> 29:41.000
I have the training to do right now.

29:44.540 --> 29:45.770
Sun Jae.

29:45.939 --> 29:47.939
(Jagam High School)

29:50.139 --> 29:51.209
Sun Jae.

29:51.879 --> 29:53.379
You can't participate in the competition this time.

29:54.250 --> 29:55.678
- Why not?
- If you do,

29:55.679 --> 29:56.750
you'll get injured again.

29:56.780 --> 29:58.550
You won't be able to swim again.

29:59.820 --> 30:00.990
So,

30:02.020 --> 30:03.790
you shouldn't enter the competition.

30:05.889 --> 30:07.060
Why not?

30:09.159 --> 30:11.260
Didn't you hear what I just said?

30:11.800 --> 30:12.829
What did you say?

30:12.830 --> 30:14.730
You'll hurt your shoulder.

30:15.500 --> 30:18.100
This tournament will be your last.

30:21.409 --> 30:23.839
What is this? A superpower?

30:23.840 --> 30:25.080
If you have nothing to say, I'll get going.

30:27.149 --> 30:29.310
Sun Jae, take a look at this.

30:29.909 --> 30:30.980
Wait a second.

30:31.119 --> 30:33.649
If you enter this competition, your athletic career will be over.

30:33.919 --> 30:35.149
Take a look at this for a second.

30:40.359 --> 30:41.760
What am I supposed to look at?

30:53.040 --> 30:55.010
(Study hall)

31:00.850 --> 31:04.179
Does the time stop when I talk about an event in the future?

31:14.760 --> 31:18.600
Obama becomes the president of the United States.

31:24.240 --> 31:26.070
What? That was scary.

31:31.609 --> 31:34.310
How did you feel after you quit swimming?

31:34.709 --> 31:37.719
I regretted, wondering if I had pushed...

31:38.080 --> 31:39.179
myself too far.

31:39.780 --> 31:42.350
Perhaps, it happened because I was destined...

31:43.119 --> 31:44.689
to be a singer.

31:46.260 --> 31:48.030
If you didn't quit swimming,

31:49.030 --> 31:50.060
you...

31:50.830 --> 31:52.830
would still be alive.

31:55.730 --> 31:57.740
(Jagam High School)

32:15.250 --> 32:17.718
You just went a little over 1 minute 50 seconds.

32:17.719 --> 32:20.329
Are you finally going to reach 1 minute and 49-second range?

32:20.330 --> 32:23.330
- Yes.
- That'll be a new record!

32:25.429 --> 32:27.830
Hyung Gu. Aren't you going to focus?

32:28.899 --> 32:29.899
Gosh.

32:33.100 --> 32:34.570
Yes. Be careful.

32:39.240 --> 32:41.010
Sun Jae. What's wrong?

32:42.149 --> 32:43.209
It's nothing.

32:44.320 --> 32:46.280
Right. Okay.

32:46.480 --> 32:48.419
(Jagam High School)

32:53.830 --> 32:55.760
I heard you'll compete in two events.

32:55.889 --> 32:57.260
I just found out about it.

32:58.300 --> 33:00.469
Why are you competing when you just got surgery?

33:00.600 --> 33:01.770
Because I can.

33:01.830 --> 33:03.270
Don't push yourself too hard.

33:03.800 --> 33:05.800
If you mess up your shoulder again,

33:05.969 --> 33:07.909
you won't be able to lift a spoon for the rest of your life.

33:07.969 --> 33:09.840
Why? Are you nervous...

33:10.209 --> 33:12.280
you'd get no medals if I make a comeback?

33:14.780 --> 33:16.209
Mind your own business.

33:18.919 --> 33:21.990
(Jagam High School)

33:26.830 --> 33:28.928
No. It was how you behaved.

33:28.929 --> 33:30.159
Stop talking nonsense.

33:30.600 --> 33:32.198
She's here again. Are you here for Sun Jae?

33:32.199 --> 33:33.569
He will come out soon.

33:33.570 --> 33:34.869
He is right back there.

33:37.070 --> 33:39.840
- My goodness!
- She'll ask him out.

33:40.040 --> 33:42.070
- Hey, Sun Jae.
- I think she'll ask him out.

33:44.679 --> 33:46.739
Sun Jae, I know I'm crossing the line.

33:46.740 --> 33:47.849
Yes, you are.

33:47.850 --> 33:50.279
They say, "Take a step back to make a leap."

33:50.280 --> 33:52.479
If I take two steps forward, I'll leap further, won't I?

33:52.480 --> 33:53.849
Check the condition of your shoulder first.

33:53.850 --> 33:55.319
They say, "Look before you leap."

33:55.320 --> 33:57.259
I don't need to. I just need to swim.

33:57.260 --> 33:59.359
You think you're in a good condition, right?

34:00.389 --> 34:01.830
But that's not the case.

34:02.760 --> 34:04.760
- Are you going to be all right?
- What?

34:06.929 --> 34:08.270
- Hey!
- Yes!

34:12.240 --> 34:13.570
You can keep following me if it's all right.

34:24.449 --> 34:25.550
He's so stubborn.

34:26.420 --> 34:28.619
I don't think I can talk him out of it. What should I do?

34:29.219 --> 34:30.219
Sir,

34:30.819 --> 34:33.159
are you acting like this over a small late fee?

34:34.389 --> 34:37.460
The small late fee doesn't matter.

34:38.130 --> 34:41.298
It can be that you make a mistake.

34:41.299 --> 34:43.639
I checked everything through and through.

34:43.940 --> 34:46.238
There's no member with a name similar to yours.

34:46.239 --> 34:48.238
So, I just can't make a mistake.

34:48.239 --> 34:50.110
Gosh. What a weird lady!

34:50.279 --> 34:52.508
If I say it's not the case, it's not the case.

34:52.509 --> 34:53.949
Did you call me a weird lady?

34:54.310 --> 34:55.349
For goodness' sake!

34:55.350 --> 34:57.948
Are you doing this because you are embarrassed...

34:57.949 --> 34:59.278
about watching a naughty movie?

34:59.279 --> 35:01.020
What? Am I embarrassed?

35:01.549 --> 35:03.019
I'm old enough.

35:03.020 --> 35:05.790
If I wanted to rent it, I would have rented it confidently.

35:06.159 --> 35:08.830
Was it "Basic Instincts?"

35:08.889 --> 35:11.258
I already watched it with my wife...

35:11.259 --> 35:13.000
in a theater a long time ago.

35:14.369 --> 35:16.769
Hey. Detective Lee. Treat him nicely.

35:16.770 --> 35:18.238
Your statement is...

35:18.239 --> 35:19.940
Gosh.

35:20.509 --> 35:23.679
My goodness. You got into a fight...

35:24.110 --> 35:25.238
because they spat on your bike?

35:25.239 --> 35:27.949
Aren't you going to swing your fist if one spits on your child?

35:29.210 --> 35:31.279
Who gave birth to your bike?

35:32.219 --> 35:33.279
My heart did.

35:33.889 --> 35:35.119
I see.

35:35.520 --> 35:36.988
Is it maternal love or paternal love?

35:36.989 --> 35:39.689
Also, they started the fight first.

35:39.690 --> 35:41.329
- Aren't you going to shut it?
- You started it.

35:41.330 --> 35:44.158
- You started it first.
- Sit down. Gosh.

35:44.159 --> 35:45.860
My goodness.

35:46.699 --> 35:49.270
Wait. Hello, sir.

35:50.670 --> 35:52.639
What brought you here, Lieutenant Kim?

35:54.139 --> 35:55.739
Do you still fight around like this?

35:56.909 --> 35:59.880
I can go since my legal guardian is here, right?

36:06.619 --> 36:08.219
Hey, Kim Tae Sung!

36:10.619 --> 36:12.619
Is he your son?

36:17.029 --> 36:19.100
Dad, it went well again today.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.900
I'm on my way home after the training.

36:23.100 --> 36:24.100
Okay.

36:25.170 --> 36:26.440
Hey, kid.

36:26.600 --> 36:29.569
Make a donation to Grandma Celestial.

36:30.380 --> 36:32.440
I see. Okay.

36:36.980 --> 36:38.049
Thank you.

36:40.650 --> 36:41.690
It's nothing.

36:43.719 --> 36:47.060
You were born in late October when the first frost falls.

36:47.259 --> 36:48.759
I see the energy of a ghost around you.

36:48.860 --> 36:51.460
The ghost's door is bolted.

36:52.500 --> 36:54.899
- You have a door for a ghost.
- Pardon?

36:54.900 --> 36:57.499
You're not feeling well physically, right?

36:57.500 --> 37:01.710
Doesn't your shoulder feel heavy?

37:02.610 --> 37:03.639
Water ghost!

37:03.909 --> 37:06.079
A ghost of an unmarried woman who unfairly died in the water...

37:06.080 --> 37:07.549
is stuck to you.

37:07.810 --> 37:08.810
A ghost?

37:08.850 --> 37:10.618
She is looking for a bachelor to take...

37:10.619 --> 37:13.080
to the underworld after passing the 49th day.

37:13.150 --> 37:15.218
Stay away from water for a while.

37:15.219 --> 37:16.989
Just for three days.

37:17.159 --> 37:19.190
The day after tomorrow is the 49th day after her death.

37:21.190 --> 37:23.999
I'm a swimmer, and I have a tournament tomorrow.

37:24.000 --> 37:26.028
Forget about the tournament. It's not important.

37:26.029 --> 37:27.269
Is it more important than your life?

37:27.270 --> 37:29.669
Unless you want to cross the Sanzu Bridge in the afterlife,

37:29.670 --> 37:31.239
don't even dip your feet in the water!

37:32.500 --> 37:34.040
Okay. I'll keep that in mind.

37:34.270 --> 37:36.540
Are you going to keep that in mind? How can I trust you?

37:37.580 --> 37:39.580
I won't even take a shower. Okay?

37:40.040 --> 37:41.310
Thanks for telling me.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.250
I don't think he's buying it.

37:45.750 --> 37:47.520
Kid. You have a mole below your collarbone, right?

37:52.489 --> 37:55.330
Well, 3 out of 10 people have moles there.

38:00.060 --> 38:03.469
She tells me you have a scar on your left sole.

38:04.699 --> 38:06.670
- Did you see it?
- She saw it.

38:07.739 --> 38:09.040
That lady.

38:15.110 --> 38:16.150
What?

38:18.420 --> 38:19.420
I don't see her.

38:22.790 --> 38:23.790
Gosh.

38:24.060 --> 38:26.020
You are sensitive about jinxes.

38:26.219 --> 38:28.060
Please trust me.

38:29.259 --> 38:30.259
What?

38:31.330 --> 38:32.360
No.

38:36.529 --> 38:37.540
What?

38:42.369 --> 38:43.880
Were you on a spiritual training?

38:44.139 --> 38:46.239
You had a fistfight.

38:49.080 --> 38:51.650
Okay. Will you give my dollar back?

38:53.219 --> 38:54.250
If I give it back,

38:54.750 --> 38:57.089
are you going to read my fortune? How is my love life?

38:59.960 --> 39:02.060
You are destined to be beaten up.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.830
I thought you liked me.

39:05.130 --> 39:06.630
Did you read the letter?

39:08.929 --> 39:10.799
There aren't many stars in the sky tonight.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.270
Are they all in my eyes?

39:14.469 --> 39:16.369
- Am I being so bright?
- Stop it!

39:17.339 --> 39:18.639
You read it so thoroughly.

39:24.279 --> 39:26.048
Was he in a group fight with students from the adjacent school?

39:26.049 --> 39:27.819
Anyway, it was a huge scandal.

39:28.049 --> 39:29.049
He could've gotten expelled,

39:29.050 --> 39:30.690
but they just let him withdraw from school.

39:32.790 --> 39:34.060
Wait here for a second.

39:36.860 --> 39:38.100
(Nuriro)

39:39.730 --> 39:41.369
Okay. Give me your hand.

39:49.040 --> 39:50.139
Be gentle.

39:50.839 --> 39:52.179
Don't leave a scar on my pretty hand.

39:52.339 --> 39:54.278
He's such a ladies' man.

39:54.279 --> 39:56.150
He discretely makes eyes at me.

39:56.880 --> 39:59.380
Gosh. This is why girls were crazy about him.

40:02.650 --> 40:04.860
Why do you fight all the time?

40:05.190 --> 40:06.520
Do you want to get expelled?

40:06.659 --> 40:08.159
You should graduate high school, at least.

40:08.589 --> 40:10.428
You're going to regret it terribly later.

40:10.429 --> 40:12.860
Are you my mom or what? Stop nitpicking.

40:13.360 --> 40:15.729
Exactly. Your parents must be worried sick.

40:15.730 --> 40:17.839
Because you even look pathetic in my eyes.

40:19.699 --> 40:20.909
I don't think they care.

40:23.210 --> 40:25.040
I thought so in the past too.

40:26.509 --> 40:27.909
But I was wrong.

40:29.009 --> 40:31.219
If children get sick, their parents feel...

40:38.119 --> 40:40.420
as if their ten fingers are pulled out.

40:41.589 --> 40:43.830
A child's cry sounds like thunder to them.

40:45.130 --> 40:46.429
That's what my mom told me.

40:50.130 --> 40:53.540
So, in order not to break your parents' hearts,

40:53.869 --> 40:57.110
don't get injured or get sick. Got it?

41:00.110 --> 41:02.380
Not all parents are like that.

41:03.949 --> 41:05.520
Well, that's true.

41:06.920 --> 41:09.850
But you'll somewhat understand this once you become an adult.

41:13.119 --> 41:14.659
Okay. All good. Right?

41:15.190 --> 41:16.259
Give back my money now.

41:20.500 --> 41:21.529
Here.

41:37.250 --> 41:39.679
My favourite star has once touched this bill.

41:41.989 --> 41:43.150
I'm sorry.

41:43.190 --> 41:44.619
I'll change it to another bill. Okay?

41:46.219 --> 41:48.989
Seriously. That face of yours is asking to be scolded.

41:49.230 --> 41:50.360
Forget it!

41:52.029 --> 41:54.069
I told you I would change it to another bill.

41:54.900 --> 41:56.130
Hey, wait.

41:57.540 --> 41:58.699
I'll change it.

42:01.540 --> 42:02.540
Here.

42:02.670 --> 42:03.670
I'll be generous.

42:03.869 --> 42:05.080
I'll change it to a five-dollar bill.

42:05.310 --> 42:07.579
- Are we good now?
- Forget it. Just go home.

42:07.580 --> 42:09.009
Go away.

42:10.210 --> 42:11.779
- Darn it.
- What's going on?

42:17.360 --> 42:18.420
"Grandma?"

42:20.560 --> 42:24.060
Goodness, young man. Funny running into you here again.

42:26.060 --> 42:27.258
You're a granny?

42:27.259 --> 42:28.770
This is crazy.

42:31.170 --> 42:32.369
You're Ryu Sun Jae, right?

42:32.839 --> 42:34.839
A friend of In Hyuk. The swimmer.

42:35.040 --> 42:36.210
Who are you?

42:36.469 --> 42:37.610
I'm Kim Tae Sung.

42:38.009 --> 42:39.980
She has a crush on Kim Tae Sung.

42:40.040 --> 42:42.080
She came and left chocolates for him secretly.

42:46.949 --> 42:49.019
Always be wary of water.

42:49.020 --> 42:50.989
I'll get going now.

42:51.159 --> 42:52.290
What are you doing?

42:53.520 --> 42:55.360
What are you trying to pull in that outfit this time?

42:56.330 --> 42:58.659
Grandma, I think you've been exposed.

42:59.130 --> 43:00.429
Darn it. What do I do?

43:03.630 --> 43:04.839
Are you making fun of me?

43:05.369 --> 43:06.569
Is this funny to you?

43:07.770 --> 43:09.310
I'm not making fun of you.

43:11.710 --> 43:13.939
Sun Jae. Please hear me out. I can really see ghosts.

43:13.940 --> 43:15.480
You really have to be careful around water!

43:15.710 --> 43:16.979
I'm telling the truth!

43:16.980 --> 43:19.250
You really have to be careful, Sun Jae! Please!

43:25.290 --> 43:26.290
What?

43:27.489 --> 43:28.830
(Ryu Geun Duk)

43:30.460 --> 43:32.060
This is Sun Jae's house?

43:32.360 --> 43:33.460
Grandma.

43:33.900 --> 43:35.029
Can you really see ghosts?

43:39.469 --> 43:40.600
Mom!

43:42.069 --> 43:43.739
- Mom.
- You startled me.

43:44.080 --> 43:46.379
When did Mr. Bae move out? The guy from the blue-gated house?

43:46.380 --> 43:48.249
What's up with your outfit? Are you in a circus show?

43:48.250 --> 43:50.408
Mr. Bae moved out in spring.

43:50.409 --> 43:52.179
Another family moved in. Did you not know that?

43:52.449 --> 43:53.819
No, I didn't.

43:54.790 --> 43:56.949
How could I have missed that?

44:04.699 --> 44:05.829
One,

44:05.830 --> 44:06.859
two,

44:06.860 --> 44:07.899
three,

44:07.900 --> 44:08.968
four,

44:08.969 --> 44:10.068
five,

44:10.069 --> 44:11.069
six,

44:11.070 --> 44:12.169
seven,

44:12.170 --> 44:13.269
eight,

44:13.270 --> 44:14.309
nine,

44:14.310 --> 44:15.310
ten,

44:15.310 --> 44:16.310
eleven,

44:16.311 --> 44:17.368
twelve,

44:17.369 --> 44:18.379
thirteen,

44:18.380 --> 44:19.380
fourteen,

44:19.380 --> 44:20.380
fifteen,

44:20.381 --> 44:21.408
sixteen,

44:21.409 --> 44:22.409
seventeen,

44:22.409 --> 44:23.409
eighteen,

44:23.410 --> 44:24.419
nineteen...

44:24.420 --> 44:25.949
You can't participate in the competition this time.

44:28.420 --> 44:29.589
Darn it.

44:40.330 --> 44:43.469
He won't believe anything I say now. What do I do?

44:56.880 --> 44:58.619
Where's he going at this hour?

45:18.000 --> 45:19.699
Check the condition of your shoulder first.

45:20.069 --> 45:22.110
They say, "Look before you leap."

45:22.710 --> 45:25.440
You think you're in a good condition, right?

45:25.810 --> 45:27.279
But that's not the case.

45:29.480 --> 45:30.979
Don't push yourself too hard.

45:30.980 --> 45:32.949
If you mess up your shoulder again,

45:33.020 --> 45:35.219
you won't be able to lift a spoon for the rest of your life.

45:45.230 --> 45:47.629
I knew it. I'm so proud of you, my son.

45:47.630 --> 45:49.770
I knew this was a piece of cake for you.

46:21.799 --> 46:23.000
Water ghost!

46:23.170 --> 46:25.368
A ghost of an unmarried woman who unfairly died in the water...

46:25.369 --> 46:26.868
is stuck to you.

46:26.869 --> 46:28.068
I can really see ghosts.

46:28.069 --> 46:29.509
You really have to be careful around water!

46:29.909 --> 46:32.380
I'm telling the truth! You really have to be careful.

46:34.509 --> 46:35.610
I

46:36.380 --> 46:38.779
I am

46:39.250 --> 46:40.279
I am

46:53.759 --> 46:55.368
This jerk believes in this superstition...

46:55.369 --> 46:56.369
that he must wear the same swim pants...

46:56.370 --> 46:57.869
he wore the day before in order to win a medal.

46:58.500 --> 46:59.869
That's why...

47:00.040 --> 47:01.469
he always practices the day before in the same swim pants.

47:01.569 --> 47:02.810
So what do you want to do?

47:07.980 --> 47:09.909
He'll be so flustered when he sees that it's gone.

47:09.980 --> 47:11.679
Hey, what if he finds out?

47:11.779 --> 47:14.019
No one will know as long as you keep your mouth shut.

47:14.020 --> 47:15.150
Are you scared?

47:23.159 --> 47:24.830
Do you want me to snap your wrist?

47:25.299 --> 47:26.429
Let go.

47:27.460 --> 47:28.900
What are you doing? Let go of me.

47:29.429 --> 47:30.999
Should I tell everyone on your swimming team?

47:31.000 --> 47:32.239
Or should I call the police?

47:32.600 --> 47:34.339
Leave the swim pants, and walk away quietly.

47:34.540 --> 47:37.009
Come on. Get your hands off it.

47:37.040 --> 47:38.738
Who's there? Hey!

47:38.739 --> 47:40.009
- Who is it?
- Darn it. Let's run away.

48:08.869 --> 48:10.069
- What do I do?
- What was that?

48:12.080 --> 48:13.480
Why is the light off?

48:26.819 --> 48:27.989
My legs are falling asleep.

48:31.299 --> 48:32.400
What?

48:48.909 --> 48:49.949
Who are you?

48:56.489 --> 48:58.659
(Advance into the water!)

49:19.739 --> 49:21.480
What? It was you?

49:26.449 --> 49:28.290
You stole my swim pants? How could you stoop this low?

49:28.719 --> 49:30.889
- No. I didn't steal them.
- What is it?

49:31.159 --> 49:32.819
What is your excuse this time?

49:33.020 --> 49:34.429
Are you going to say a ghost stole them?

49:35.389 --> 49:36.829
Why are you doing this to me?

49:36.830 --> 49:38.259
I did it because I was worried.

49:39.400 --> 49:41.469
I don't know how to explain this.

49:42.670 --> 49:43.769
Yes, a dream.

49:43.770 --> 49:45.040
I had a bad dream.

49:45.670 --> 49:48.408
In my dream, you were badly injured at the competition.

49:48.409 --> 49:49.839
It was so vivid as if it were real.

49:50.210 --> 49:52.479
I got the feeling that it would happen in real life.

49:52.480 --> 49:53.609
So I was nervous and worried.

49:53.610 --> 49:54.880
Why are you worried about me?

49:56.980 --> 49:58.318
Because I want to protect you!

49:58.319 --> 49:59.380
Why?

49:59.619 --> 50:00.850
Why do you want to protect me?

50:01.150 --> 50:02.249
It's not like I'm going to die.

50:02.250 --> 50:03.519
Yes. That's right. You'll die.

50:03.520 --> 50:04.960
You're going to die.

50:05.560 --> 50:07.830
I'm the only one in the world who knows that.

50:08.389 --> 50:09.830
But I can't even tell you that.

50:10.730 --> 50:12.730
Despite that, I still want to protect you.

50:13.230 --> 50:15.500
I'm doing everything I can to save you.

50:18.839 --> 50:20.400
Why can't you say anything?

50:22.469 --> 50:24.739
Do you think all these behaviours of yours are normal?

50:25.080 --> 50:26.210
Don't you think this is weird?

50:26.339 --> 50:28.008
We were strangers before.

50:28.009 --> 50:29.009
But you came to me and said you were my fan.

50:29.150 --> 50:31.250
Then all of a sudden, you don't want me to compete?

50:32.020 --> 50:33.319
Just because you had a bad dream?

50:33.880 --> 50:35.049
Who do you think you are?

50:35.619 --> 50:37.449
Why must I do what you say?

51:01.009 --> 51:03.179
My son, I brought dumplings.

51:07.080 --> 51:09.619
He's supposed to leave early in the morning. Where did he go?

51:10.989 --> 51:12.389
Goodness.

51:12.920 --> 51:14.928
These dumplings are tasty when they're eaten warm.

51:14.929 --> 51:17.329
Goodness. He'll eat them when he gets hungry.

51:17.330 --> 51:18.630
Boys at his age can even chew on rocks.

51:21.600 --> 51:22.699
What's that?

51:27.639 --> 51:28.770
What is that?

51:32.839 --> 51:33.980
What is that?

51:41.819 --> 51:43.020
What on earth...

51:47.219 --> 51:48.659
("Basic Instincts")

51:57.969 --> 52:00.040
- What is it?
- You were at the pool, right?

52:00.670 --> 52:02.170
- Did you run into Hyung Gu?
- What?

52:02.739 --> 52:05.279
That jerk wanted to mess with you, so he went to the swimming pool.

52:05.540 --> 52:07.039
You guys didn't fight, right?

52:07.040 --> 52:08.309
That jerk was at the pool?

52:08.310 --> 52:10.709
Yes. He wanted to steal your swim pants.

52:10.710 --> 52:12.750
- Gosh. Seriously.
- Nothing happened, right?

52:13.350 --> 52:16.520
Goodness. Don't you think that jerk is crossing the line?

52:18.360 --> 52:19.460
Hello?

52:20.319 --> 52:21.560
Are you there, Sun Jae?

52:39.880 --> 52:41.350
Why can't you say anything?

52:42.150 --> 52:44.350
Do you think all these behaviours of yours are normal?

52:44.380 --> 52:46.449
He's right. I'm not acting like a normal person.

52:49.190 --> 52:51.920
I don't even know what I'm doing right now.

53:09.069 --> 53:10.210
One,

53:10.770 --> 53:11.880
two,

53:13.380 --> 53:14.509
three,

53:15.610 --> 53:16.710
four,

53:17.350 --> 53:18.449
five...

54:04.360 --> 54:06.029
Hey, Sol!

54:20.409 --> 54:21.449
Are you crazy?

54:21.909 --> 54:23.110
Why didn't you step away? Why did you stand there?

54:55.179 --> 54:56.850
Thirty-four dash one.

54:59.179 --> 55:00.420
It got delivered to the wrong house.

55:00.650 --> 55:01.889
(34-1, Nuri-dong)

55:05.319 --> 55:06.589
Sir!

55:39.920 --> 55:41.020
This package is for me, right?

55:41.929 --> 55:43.029
It is mine.

55:44.830 --> 55:46.130
You should take this umbrella, sir.

55:48.000 --> 55:49.429
Come on. Take it now.

55:51.299 --> 55:53.138
Just take it with you. You can drop it off...

55:53.139 --> 55:55.440
in the umbrella stand in front of the store at any time.

55:55.569 --> 55:57.310
I'm giving you the umbrella because I feel bad, actually.

55:57.610 --> 55:59.138
The next package is going to be quite heavy.

55:59.139 --> 56:00.940
I bought a whole bunch of stuff.

56:03.250 --> 56:05.479
And one more thing. Have this.

56:05.480 --> 56:06.719
Bye now.

57:52.360 --> 57:54.089
Give me the name of your account, please.

57:55.989 --> 57:58.190
It's Ryu Geun Duk.

58:04.230 --> 58:05.500
("Basic Instincts")

58:13.540 --> 58:14.839
Sun Jae!

58:16.880 --> 58:18.679
What? What's going on?

58:19.719 --> 58:20.850
Am I dreaming?

58:24.089 --> 58:25.719
Be my Ilchon!

58:27.790 --> 58:30.560
My son! Have some vegetable juice.

58:30.630 --> 58:31.630
(You declined the request.)

58:33.730 --> 58:35.830
Come on, Dad! Why can't you knock?

59:06.500 --> 59:09.000
It feels like we are getting further away.

59:09.699 --> 59:11.739
He refused to be my Ilchon.

59:14.170 --> 59:17.069
It seems he has no interest in becoming friends with me.

01:00:13.299 --> 01:00:15.270
(Do not cross, Police line, Under investigation)

01:00:45.230 --> 01:00:48.060
(Lovely Runner)

01:00:48.259 --> 01:00:49.469
I'm going to compete in the tournament.

01:00:49.630 --> 01:00:51.769
I'll compete and win a medal no matter what.

01:00:51.770 --> 01:00:53.069
Just wait until I win the gold medal.

01:00:53.239 --> 01:00:54.799
I'll tell her I like her.

01:00:54.940 --> 01:00:56.468
- Right.
- Make sure your timing is good.

01:00:56.469 --> 01:00:58.170
It's all about the timing when telling a girl how you feel.

01:00:58.509 --> 01:00:59.509
This is the right time.

01:00:59.509 --> 01:01:00.509
There's something...

01:01:01.409 --> 01:01:03.178
It's about Kim Tae Sung, the bass guitarist in the band.

01:01:03.179 --> 01:01:05.419
Are you his fan? Or do you have feelings for him?

01:01:05.420 --> 01:01:07.580
Do you want to date me? You said you liked me.

01:01:08.179 --> 01:01:09.419
Where's Sun Jae?

01:01:09.420 --> 01:01:10.819
I didn't see him during the swimming drills.

01:01:10.920 --> 01:01:12.589
- I'll quit swimming.
- You brat.

01:01:15.860 --> 01:01:17.028
I stopped it.

01:01:17.029 --> 01:01:18.159
I like you.

01:01:18.259 --> 01:01:20.429
I have feelings for you.

01:01:24.516 --> 01:01:26.416
Dramaday.me
